    "remarks": "Comment added by Amal on June 10 2026\nMS372925NDZR8R - Skills Ready - MassMutual Ascend - Cloud Security: Microsoft Azure Infrastructure and Application Security\nPPT: Is not updated as per new format.\nLab guide: Scenario sections need to be added in lab guide\n \nIssue: \nEx 3 Task 3 Step 14: Many users were getting failure in updating the firewall policy here.\nIn the instructions there's a note which mentions to delete the Key vault, and managed identity and try updating the policy again. But even after trying for 3-4 times it failed for many users.\n \nWorkaround: We tried disabling the TLS inspection once. Then deleted the key vault and managed identity, then performed the step 14 again, which worked for few users. But for few others this workaround also did not worked, hence they were forced to continue ahead.",
    "releaseNoteStatus": "Added",
    "releaseNoteLink": "https://github.com/CloudLabsAI-Azure/MS-Innovation-Release-Notes/blob/main/Infrastructure-and-Application-Security/Release-Notes.md",
    "pptLink": "Infrastructure and application security.pptx",
    "pptStatus": "PPT needs to be updated in new format",
    "comments": "Comment added by Amal on June 10 2026\nMS372925NDZR8R - Skills Ready - MassMutual Ascend - Cloud Security: Microsoft Azure Infrastructure and Application Security\nPPT: Is not updated as per new format.\nLab guide: Scenario sections need to be added in lab guide\n \nIssue: \nEx 3 Task 3 Step 14: Many users were getting failure in updating the firewall policy here.\nIn the instructions there's a note which mentions to delete the Key vault, and managed identity and try updating the policy again. But even after trying for 3-4 times it failed for many users.\n \nWorkaround: We tried disabling the TLS inspection once. Then deleted the key vault and managed identity, then performed the step 14 again, which worked for few users. But for few others this workaround also did not worked, hence they were forced to continue ahead. | Review completed",
    "lastUpdatedBy": "Manoj Gowda",
